  m_text: "Officials were quick to question the unusual maneuver. The runner, however,
    offered little explanation when approached after the race. Some spectators insist
    that the shortcut was carefully planned, while others believe that the confusion
    of the crowd made the maneuver possible.\nThe incident has already divided the
    public. Supporters claim that cleverness is simply another form of speed, while
    traditionalists argue that a race is meaningless when its rules can be ignored.
    Whatever the truth may be, one thing is certain: yesterday\u2019s contest will
    not soon be forgotten."
